    {
      "source": "Create a <code>ScheduledMethodRunnable</code> for the given target instance,\ncalling the specified method.",
      "translation": "为给定的目标实例创建<code>ScheduledMethodRunnable</code>，调用指定的方法。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>target</code> - the target instance to call the method on",
      "translation": "<code>target</code> - 要调用方法的实例",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>method</code> - the target method to call",
      "translation": "<code>method</code> - 要调用的目标方法",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "May be used for custom purposes depending on the scheduler implementation.\n<a href=\"../config/TaskSchedulerRouter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.config\"><code>TaskSchedulerRouter</code></a> introspects\nthis qualifier in order to determine the target scheduler to be used\nfor a given Runnable, matching the qualifier value (or the bean name)\nof a specific <a href=\"../TaskScheduler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\"><code>TaskScheduler</code></a> or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledExecutorService.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledExecutorService</code></a> bean definition.",
      "translation": "可根据调度器实现的不同用于自定义目的。\n<a href=\"../config/TaskSchedulerRouter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.config\"><code>TaskSchedulerRouter</code></a> 会检查此限定符，以确定针对给定的 Runnable 要使用的目标调度器，匹配特定 <a href=\"../TaskScheduler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\"><code>TaskScheduler</code></a> 或\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/ScheduledExecutorService.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>ScheduledExecutorService</code></a> bean 定义的限定符值（或 bean 名称）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../SchedulingAwareRunnable.html#getQualifier()\">SchedulingAwareRunnable</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../SchedulingAwareRunnable.html#getQualifier()\">SchedulingAwareRunnable</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Variant of <a href=\"MethodInvokingRunnable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.scheduling.support\"><code>MethodInvokingRunnable</code></a> meant to be used for processing\nof no-arg scheduled methods. Propagates user exceptions to the caller,\nassuming that an error strategy for Runnables is in place.",
      "translation": "`MethodInvokingRunnable` 的变体，旨在用于处理无参调度方法。它将用户异常传播给调用者，前提是已为 Runnable 配置了错误处理策略。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <code>ScheduledMethodRunnable</code> for the given target instance,\ncalling the specified method by name.",
      "translation": "为给定的目标实例创建一个<code>ScheduledMethodRunnable</code>，通过指定名称调用该方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the target method to call.",
      "translation": "返回要调用的目标方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the target instance to call the method on.",
      "translation": "返回目标实例以调用该方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../SchedulingAwareRunnable.html#getQualifier()\">getQualifier</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../SchedulingAwareRunnable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\">SchedulingAwareRunnable</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../SchedulingAwareRunnable.html#getQualifier()\">getQualifier</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"../SchedulingAwareRunnable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.scheduling\">SchedulingAwareRunnable</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/NoSuchMethodException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">NoSuchMethodException</a></code> - if the specified method does not exist",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/NoSuchMethodException.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\">NoSuchMethodException</a></code> - 如果指定的方法不存在",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>qualifier</code> - a qualifier associated with this Runnable,\nfor example, for determining a scheduler to run this scheduled method on",
      "translation": "<code>qualifier</code> - 与此 Runnable 关联的限定符，例如用于确定要在其上运行此定时方法的调度器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>observationRegistrySupplier</code> - a supplier for the observation registry to use",
      "translation": "<code>observationRegistrySupplier</code> - 用于提供观测注册表的供应器",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>methodName</code> - the name of the target method",
      "translation": "<code>methodName</code> - 目标方法的名称",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation returns <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "默认实现返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a qualifier associated with this Runnable.",
      "translation": "返回与此 Runnable 关联的限定符。",
      "count": 1
